WEBVTT

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.790
Here I go, Agari-chan!

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.960
<i>Keep your eyes peeled.</i>

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>This is... This is...</i>

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.000
This is

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.770
who I am...

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.430
A-At least clear five
vaulting boxes, come on.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:49.170
You look lame, Taily!

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:50.550
Put your heart into it!

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:55.950
<i>I hate P.E. so much.</i>

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:24.230
<b>Scorching</b>

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:24.230
<b>Ping Pong Girls</b>

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:30.790
<b>Fourth Serve</b>

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:30.790
<b>Boring Table Tennis</b>

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.750
Suzumegahara Municipal Junior High

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.750
<i>Suzumegahara Junior High.</i>

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:37.910
<i>It's been a few weeks
since I transferred here.</i>

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:40.430
<b>Table Tennis 
Team</b>

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:49.730
<i>I love table tennis, and I get to play
every day! It's so much fun!</i>

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:53.560
<i>But what I love most...</i>

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.110
<i>is how playing with Agari-chan
always makes my heart race!</i>

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:05.200
11-9! Game to Agari-senpai!

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.520
Agari-senpai won!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:11.080
She defended her spot as ace!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.540
How d'you like that, Koyori?
I win again today!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.740
Yeah, Agari-chan!

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:25.800
Come on, Koyori! Why are
<i>you</i> beaming when <i>you</i> lost?!

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:30.610
Agari-senpai pulled her cheeks!

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:33.060
Koyori-senpai's cheeks are in trouble!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:37.690
But playing you is just so much fun.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.700
I-It's fun for me, too.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.630
But unless you act a little upset,

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.950
it won't feel like heated competition.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:49.750
And don't you have better things
to do than watch me all the time?

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.150
Like going running or doing practice swings?!

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.970
It's become a regular thing now, hasn't it?

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:56.520
Matches for the top spot
after practice!

00:03:56.520 --> 00:04:06.350
<b>1. Kamiya Agari
2. Tsumujikaze Koyori
3. Tenka Hanabi
4. Itsumo Hokuto
5. Munemune</b>

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.330
They're so evenly matched.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:03.130
The number one spot changes
so frequently, we can hardly keep up.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:05.810
Agari-chan stayed number one today, huh?

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:10.340
Now their head-to-head record is 7-7.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.910
Whoa! Truly equals!

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:16.370
Guess we can't take our eyes
off them for a while yet!

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:18.940
Equals, huh?

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:23.710
But Koyori-chan's been on
a losing streak, hasn't she?

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:28.430
Peach Panties has now lost
three straight to White Panties.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:32.080
Really? Is she in bad shape?

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:37.940
Unlike Agari-chan, Koyori-chan lacks
a certain critical something.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:42.730
And it probably played a part
in the recent results.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:46.030
Taily lacks something?

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:47.270
Yup.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:50.470
Their head-to-head record is even right now,

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:56.610
but there's a chance Agari-chan
will leave her in the dust eventually.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:57.810
Maybe.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:03.280
It's okay. You don't have to
rack your brain that hard.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.700
M-Munemune-senpai.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:10.190
Uh, well...

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:16.710
Can I count on your help tomorrow, too?

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.090
Yeah, of course!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.280
You've been so into it lately.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.790
I guess it's all thanks to Koyori—

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.700
Koyori has nothing to do with it!

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:31.680
Magawy-jan!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.640
<i>Are they talking about me?</i>

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.690
Oh, I nearly forgot.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:38.370
Listen up, everyone!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:41.690
Our captain's coming back tomorrow!
Keep that in mind!

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:43.150
Captain?

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:45.400
Really?

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.260
Really.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.850
She's been looking forward
to seeing you all again.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:52.700
The captain's finally back in action?

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.940
Should be good, huh, Hokuto?

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:56.370
Beam, beam.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:58.780
Did she just say "captain"?

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:01.840
Come to think of it, we've never met her.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.210
<i>The captain's coming back?</i>

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.800
<b>Class 2-3</b>

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:11.450
That's cute!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.760
When you add six to <i>y</i> here,

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:16.620
you'll have <i>x</i> isolated here, right?

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.550
Substitute that into the second equation.

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:23.530
Hey!

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.830
Quit spacing out.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.520
S-Sorry!

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.950
Say, what's the captain like?

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.600
Sh-She's probably good, right? How good?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:42.380
Huh? E-Er...

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.140
Very good.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:46.530
Maybe even better than Agari.

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.970
Hana-chan.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.550
Before she took time off from the team,

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:53.870
she and Agari used to
trade wins back and forth

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:57.070
in a fierce battle for the top spot.

00:06:57.070 --> 00:07:00.180
A fierce battle for the top spot...

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:10.140
Who knows what the rankings will look like
with the captain back in the fray?

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:13.890
Basically, Agari was just pretending
to be queen of the mountain.

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:16.750
I-I wasn't!

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:21.080
Even if we played now,
I'd crush the captain like a bug!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:27.170
Th-Though I will admit she's good.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:28.860
Wow!

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:33.040
She must be really good
if she's got your respect!

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.660
W-Well, yeah.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:35.630
Awesome!

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.030
The captain, huh?

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:40.600
I so want to play her!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:45.610
You turn into a different person
when table tennis is involved, Taily!

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.910
Y-You're being too rough!

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:50.190
You seriously love the game!

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:53.070
She's a total dimwit
outside of table tennis, though.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.280
Tail?!

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:57.290
Can't handle P.E. <i>or</i> studies.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:00.200
Forgets things often, falls over a lot...

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.310
She makes my heart race in a <i>very</i>
different way from a table tennis match.

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:09.140
She's really going to town on you, Taily.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:13.480
That said, you're always helping Taily out.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:17.330
I mean, even now,
you're helping her study during lunch.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.540
You're so nice, Agari.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.060
Thank you, Agari-chan.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.740
Y-You've got it all wrong!

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:28.940
I'm just forced to look out for her
because she sits next to me!

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.320
She's blushing!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:33.090
I-I am not!

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:40.620
<b>Class 2-4</b>

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.460
Hokuto! Let's go to practice!

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:49.920
Coming.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:59.300
I'm gonna give it my all
in practice again today!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.340
Oh, someone's here already.

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:31.340
She's dealing with

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:36.090
two table tennis robots at once!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:53.690
Yeah, playing robots really is boring.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:56.590
Oh?

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.860
Captain!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:58.820
It's the captain!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.030
Woohoo!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.370
Oh, hey, I'm back.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.990
You seem well, Hanabi.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:06.190
And you're as spiky as ever.

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:09.000
Ow, your hair just stabbed my palm.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.840
How about you, Hokuto?

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.330
Beaming?

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:13.460
Beam, beam.

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:17.920
And your arrow is still
nice and sharp, Agari.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.680
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:24.140
<i>This is the captain.</i>

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.250
Is this girl...

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.480
She's a transfer student.

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.290
A second-year like us, and...

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.110
Come on. Introduce yourself.

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:38.820
I-I'm... Tsumujikaze Koyori.

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:43.080
She's not trying to be rude.

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:45.870
She's just extremely shy.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.330
My, my.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:51.080
She may not look it,
but Taily's crazy good, Captain!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:57.050
<b>Kamiya Agari</b>

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:57.050
<b>Tsumujikaze Koyori</b>

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:54.740
Oh, you're right. She's second.

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:57.070
Guess what I heard from Munemune was true.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:59.700
Nice to meetcha, Koyori-chan.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.570
I-It's nice to meet you, too!

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:04.510
Hey!

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.990
Nice to meetcha. Nice to meetcha.

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:11.880
Nice to meetcha. Nice to meetcha.

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:12.620
Meetcha.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:13.490
Nice.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:14.150
Meet?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.230
Nice to meet.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.100
Nice to meetcha.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.370
Meet to nicecha.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.550
Nice, nice to meetcha.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:28.790
Nice to meetcha.

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:28.790
Jeez, stop using me to mess around!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:39.760
Table Tennis 
Team

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.760
So, yeah,

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:45.400
I'm Ushirode Kiruka, the captain,
and I'm back on the team starting today.

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:50.930
I don't believe the first-years
have seen me before.

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:53.610
Nice to meet you.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.180
That's the captain?

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:59.550
Wait, why's she panting?

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.610
Welcome back, Kiruka!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.080
Is your foot really okay now?

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:10.090
It is.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:12.290
Wanna lick and see?

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:15.080
I said I don't!

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:17.670
Munemune.

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:23.590
Thank you for holding down the fort
while I was gone.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:26.970
I'm happy I can play
table tennis with you again.

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:32.480
P-Please! I only did
my job as vice-captain!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.950
Ah, this is it!

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:40.190
How I've missed my boob pillow!

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.170
Wh-What are you doing out of the blue?!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:47.430
Well, I ran around a bit,
and now I'm beat.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.700
This is so soothing.

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:53.270
I see nothing's changed.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:56.880
<i>I never knew that soft rack
could be used like that.</i>

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.030
Zzz.

00:12:58.030 --> 00:12:59.340
Don't sleep on me!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.300
Fully healed!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:05.010
I'd like to get right to practice, then.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.800
But, before that...

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:13.080
How about we face off today?

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.310
Me versus all of you.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.890
A-Against the captain?!

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:20.670
Yeah.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:23.320
Against all twenty of us?!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.460
Yep.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.340
All by yourself?

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:27.740
That's right.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:31.760
As you all know,
the tournament's coming up soon.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:36.060
So I figured we should pick the roster
for the team play.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:39.960
To that end, I need to know
just how good each of you is.

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:46.420
If you beat me, I promise you
an automatic spot on the roster.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:47.800
Just like that?!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:51.050
Matches to select the roster
for the team play?

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:55.200
Knowing you, it's not
any normal match, right?

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:57.340
Smart, Munemune! So smart!

00:13:57.340 --> 00:14:00.130
You don't have a massive rack for nothing.

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:02.520
L-Leave my rack out of it!

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:04.480
Meow.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:08.220
These matches are sort of a dare.

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:12.950
Anyone who loses to me
has to wear cat ears!

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:15.020
I knew it!

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:17.410
Kiruka's dare or dare!

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.460
Dare or dare?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:26.020
She likes imposing penalties
on daily practice sessions and matches.

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:29.740
And her absolute favorite is cosplay!

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.840
Bunny girl!

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:34.810
She'll make you wear
the most embarrassing outfits!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.430
Maid!

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:45.980
Anyone who loses will wear these
until end of practice today.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:47.050
Meow.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.410
Over my dead body!

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:50.610
Meow!

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:55.930
Also, like, you're as good as
Agari-chan, our number one.

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:59.230
Isn't forcing everyone you beat
to wear cat ears too unfair?

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.330
I'll give you a handicap, then.

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.090
A handicap?

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:10.090
Obviously, I don't have the stamina
to play eleven-point games with all of you.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:12.260
One point.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:18.080
The challenger wins if they score
one point before I score five.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.290
If not, I win.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.480
I'll take you all on under these rules!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.080
Are we really doing this?

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.540
Taking on the captain?

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:28.440
One point should be doable, right?

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:29.710
<b>Lots</b>

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.420
Let's get started, then.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:34.460
We'll draw lots for the order.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:36.120
<i>She made that herself?</i>

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:40.590
The first challenger...

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.210
<b>Lots</b>

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.700
Who will it be?

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.300
<i>It begins...</i>

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:50.670
<i>The twenty-prong battle
between the captain and us!</i>

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.180
It's this girl!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.600
All right!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:03.370
The first challenger is
the third-ranked Hanabi-senpai.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.610
Is the captain really good?

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:08.480
Yeah.

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:12.940
Her play style is like
the polar opposite of mine.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:14.410
Opposite?

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.490
Take that!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.190
That's right.

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:24.770
Her best stroke is one that
imparts backspin on the ball.

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:28.840
She's a master of the chop.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:32.410
The high amount of backspin on the ball

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:36.430
makes it feel as heavy as lead
and impossible to lift.

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:42.430
If you return it like a normal shot,
you'll hit nothing but net.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:46.270
Aw, I should've known!

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:51.780
As opposed to my loop drive,

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:56.130
a stroke which uses topspin to make
the ball jump off the opponent's racket,

00:16:56.600 --> 00:17:01.330
the captain's chops use backspin to make
the ball die off the opponent's racket.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:08.590
Down

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:12.710
Down

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:19.930
Down

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:24.180
Her play style focuses on scoring
by forcing errors.

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:28.560
She's what is called

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:31.690
a chopper!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:38.570
<b>Chop</b>

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:38.570
Before her, every attack is
chopped down and nullified!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.400
Meow.

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:42.990
I lost!

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.960
Cute.

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:48.070
Meow.

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:50.540
Cute...

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.630
Meow.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.590
Cute!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.050
Meow...

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.970
Hngh!

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:07.590
Rack pillow, cat ears version!

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:09.820
Seriously, cut it out!

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:11.770
She's a rather problematic person,

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.480
but as a player, she's the real deal.

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:15.240
Well, then.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:24.040
Whose turn is it next
to become a kitty-cat, meow?

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.370
Oho?

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:33.290
Well, this is interesting.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.070
<b>Hokuto</b>

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.630
Beam.

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:40.550
Mwaha.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:42.050
Beam...

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.350
Mwaha...

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.220
Beam!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.140
Mwaha!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:45.850
Beam!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:46.890
Mwaha!

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:47.240
Beam!

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:47.980
Mwaha!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:48.390
Beam!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:48.830
Mwaha!

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:49.230
Beam!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:49.640
Mwaha!

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.830
Beam, beam.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:04.530
Mwahaha.

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:08.730
Meow.

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:12.930
Too bad, Hokuto!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.000
But those cat ears look great on you!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.080
That doesn't make me happy right meow.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.300
You're so cold!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:29.270
Down

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:24.220
Even the fourth-ranked Hokuto-senpai lost!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:26.140
That makes eighteen down.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:29.270
Nobody has beaten the Captain yet!

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:32.710
The only ones left are Koyori-senpai...

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.720
...and Agari-senpai?

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:37.630
Is she going through all twenty now?

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:39.240
Is she really?!

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:43.420
<i>Wow, just wow.</i>

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:47.460
<i>Our captain is so amazing!</i>

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:52.790
I'm bored now.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.220
You're the one who started this!

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:59.160
What do you mean, you're bored now?!

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:01.910
Sheesh!

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:03.010
Well, I just don't need this many kitties.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:07.090
I regret not switching
to dog ears halfway through.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:07.850
Dog ears?!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.260
Talk about selfish!

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.940
Sorry, sorry.

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:14.810
I haven't played in a while,

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.900
so I wanted to have some thrilling matches,

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:20.230
but I guess I was asking for too much.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:27.400
I never expected to find
that none of you could beat me.

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:41.460
With such boring results,
there's no way we're making Nationals.

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:47.740
Listen to yourself, Captain.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:51.390
Agari-chan?

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:59.650
Save those words for <i>after</i> you beat me!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.590
Agari-chan!

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:08.280
Suzumegahara Junior High's best-ever
team play result is the city quarterfinals.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:12.710
We keep tripping up
one match away from Nationals.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:15.160
We've been constantly frustrated.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.790
That's why we've practiced
more than ever

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.130
so that we'd make it
to Nationals this year, for sure!

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:26.930
We are definitely
going to Nationals this time!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.890
Nationals?

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:34.300
Right.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.740
Where the representatives
of each prefecture

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:39.360
come together to decide
who's the best of them all.

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:42.320
Nothing could be more exciting!

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:50.370
I see, I see.

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:52.580
Then, this match...

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:52.580
<b>Agari</b>

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:54.610
It's Agari-senpai!

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:58.630
It's finally time for
the captain versus Agari-senpai!

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:04.220
...won't bore me, I take it?

00:23:43.860 --> 00:24:00.000
Preview

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:48.070
My dream is to win Nationals
and be number one!

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:49.940
The captain's skills are unreal today.

00:23:49.180 --> 00:23:51.890
Why are <i>you</i> boasting
about it, Munemune-senpai?

00:23:51.100 --> 00:23:53.160
I don't have a weakness!

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:55.630
It hadn't even crossed my mind.

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:57.550
Meow!
